    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram FAQ bot that answers from your Google Sheet\nA Telegram bot that answers customer questions using only the facts in your Google Sheet, and gives your phone number when it doesn't know.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8745a9bb-9ad5-54b6-9ee9-2fd950f4f0b6",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Create a bot with **@BotFather** in Telegram and copy its token into a Telegram credential in n8n (you paste it, nobody else).\n2. Make a Google Sheet with a tab **Knowledge** and two headers: `topic`, `answer`. Add your real facts.\n3. Open **Settings**: business name, phone, booking link, sheet URL.\n4. Connect Telegram, Google Sheets and OpenAI, then switch to **Active** and message your bot.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "cb196ebf-5add-545c-adee-add161e2f77c",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
